---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OptimizedImage from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';

const title = "CNC Frezeleme Hizmetleri | TARGET MAKİNA";
const description = "TARGET MAKİNA CNC frezeleme hizmetleri. 3, 4 ve 5 eksenli CNC freze tezgahları ile alüminyum, çelik, titanyum ve plastik malzemelerde hassas üretim. DMG MORI ecoMill 600V ve ecoMill 70 ile üstun kalite.";
const keywords = "CNC frezeleme, CNC freze, hassas frezeleme, 3 eksen freze, 4 eksen freze, 5 eksen freze, DMG MORI, Target Makina, İzmir CNC, metal işleme, Telerezyon, İzmir Telerezyon, CNC 5 Eksen, Mastar İmalatı, Fikstür İmalatı, Talaşlı İmalat, Hassas Talaşlı imalat";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  HERO 
<section class="page-hero">
<div class="hero-bg"><OptimizedImage alt="CNC Frezeleme" src="assets/images/cnc-freze/hero.png"/></div>
<div class="hero-overlay"></div>
<div class="container hero-content">
<p class="breadcrumb-nav"><a href="/">Ana Sayfa</a> » <a href="/hizmetler/">Hizmetler</a> » CNC Frezeleme</p>
<h1>CNC Frezeleme<br/><span>Hizmetleri</span></h1>
<p class="hero-desc">3, 4 ve 5 eksenli CNC freze tezgahlarımız ile prototipten seri üretime, her türlü metal ve plastik malzemede hassas frezeleme çözümleri.</p>
<a class="hero-cta" href="/iletisim/">Teklif Al →</a>
</div>
</section>
 STATS 
<section class="stats-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">±0.01</div><div class="stat-label">mm Tolerans</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">12K</div><div class="stat-label">RPM Mil Devri</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">600</div><div class="stat-label">kg Maks. Parça</div></div></div>
<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><div class="stat-box"><div class="stat-number">30</div><div class="stat-label">Takım Kapasitesi</div></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 CAPABILITIES CARDS 
<section class="caps-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-5">
<span class="section-tag">Kabiliyetler</span>
<h2 class="section-title">CNC Frezeleme Çözümlerimiz</h2>
<p class="section-desc" style="margin:0 auto">Temel 3 eksenden karmaşık 5 eksene kadar kapsamlı CNC frezeleme hizmetleri sunuyoruz.</p>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<div class="cap-card">
<div class="cap-visual"><span class="axis-label">3X</span><span class="axis-icon">⚙</span></div>
<div class="cap-body">
<h3>3 Eksen CNC Frezeleme</h3>
<p>En yaygın CNC işleme yöntemi. X, Y ve Z eksenlerinde hareket eden takım ile düz yüzeyler, cep boşlukları ve delik işlemleri gerçekleştirilir.</p>
<ul class="cap-specs">
<li><span>Eksen</span><strong>X, Y, Z</strong></li>
<li><span>Uygunluk</span><strong>Düz parçalar, plakalar</strong></li>
<li><span>Maliyet</span><strong>En ekonomik</strong></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<div class="cap-card">
<div class="cap-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a1a,#333)"><span class="axis-label">4X</span><span class="axis-icon">★</span></div>
<div class="cap-body">
<h3>4 Eksen CNC Frezeleme</h3>
<p>Üç eksene A ekseni (X ekseni etrafında dönme) eklenerek daha karmaşık geometriler tek bağlamada işlenir. Silindirik parçalar için idealdir.</p>
<ul class="cap-specs">
<li><span>Eksen</span><strong>X, Y, Z + A</strong></li>
<li><span>Uygunluk</span><strong>Silindirik, açılı parçalar</strong></li>
<li><span>Avantaj</span><strong>Daha az kurulum</strong></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">
<div class="cap-card">
<div class="cap-visual" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2d1a0a,#4a2010)"><span class="axis-label">5X</span><span class="axis-icon">◆</span></div>
<div class="cap-body">
<h3>5 Eksen CNC Frezeleme</h3>
<p>Üç doğrusal ve iki dönme ekseni ile eş zamanlı hareket sağlanır. Karmaşık eğrisel yüzeyler, türbin kanatları ve medikal implantlar için idealdir.</p>
<ul class="cap-specs">
<li><span>Eksen</span><strong>X, Y, Z + B, C</strong></li>
<li><span>Uygunluk</span><strong>Karmaşık geometri</strong></li>
<li><span>Tolerans</span><strong>±0.005mm</strong></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 INTRO 
<section class="intro-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="row align-items-center">
<div class="col-lg-6 mb-4 mb-lg-0">
<div class="intro-image">
<OptimizedImage alt="CNC Frezeleme ile Üretilen Parçalar" src="assets/images/cnc-freze/parcalar.png"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6">
<span class="section-tag">Hakkında</span>
<h2 class="section-title">CNC Frezeleme Nedir?</h2>
<p class="section-desc">CNC frezeleme, dönen kesici takımların iş parçasından talaş kaldırarak istenen geometriyi oluşturduğu bilgisayar kontrollü bir üretim yöntemidir. TARGET MAKİNA olarak DMG MORI ecoMill 600V ve ecoMill 70 tezgahlarımız ile yüksek hassasiyetli frezeleme hizmeti sunuyoruz.</p>
<ul class="check-list">
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Prototipten seri üretime kadar esnek kapasite</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Alüminyum, çelik, titanyum, pirinch ve plastik malzemeler</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>12.000 RPM yüksek hızlı mil ile hızlı üretim</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>30 takımlık otomatik takım değiştirici</li>
<li><span class="ico">✓</span>Hexagon CMM ile 3 boyutlu kalite kontrol</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 SPECS TABLE 
<section class="specs-section" style="background:#f8f8f8">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-5">
<span class="section-tag">Teknik Veriler</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Tezgah Kapasitelerimiz</h2>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
<table class="specs-table">
<thead><tr><th colspan="2">DMG MORI ecoMill 600V</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>İşleme Alanı (X/Y/Z)</td><td>600 x 560 x 510 mm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mil Devri</td><td>12.000 RPM</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mil Gücü</td><td>13/9 kW</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tabla Boyutu</td><td>900 x 560 mm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Maks. Parça Ağırlığı</td><td>600 kg</td></tr>
<tr><td>Takım Magazini</td><td>30 takım</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hızlı İlerleme</td><td>30 m/dk</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
<table class="specs-table">
<thead><tr><th colspan="2">DMG MORI ecoMill 70 (5 Eksen)</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>İşleme Alanı (X/Y/Z)</td><td>750 x 600 x 520 mm</td></tr>
<tr><td>B Ekseni</td><td>-10° ~ +95°</td></tr>
<tr><td>C Ekseni</td><td>360° (0.001°)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mil Devri</td><td>12.000 RPM</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tabla Boyutu</td><td>800 x 620 mm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Maks. Parça Ağırlığı</td><td>350 kg</td></tr>
<tr><td>Takım Magazini</td><td>32 takım</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 MATERIALS 
<section class="materials-section" style="background:#fff">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-4">
<span class="section-tag">Malzemeler</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Frezeleyebildiğimiz Malzemeler</h2>
</div>
<h3 class="mat-subtitle">◆ Metal Malzemeler</h3>
<div class="mat-grid">
<div class="mat-chip">Alüminyum</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Paslanmaz Çelik</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Çelik</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Titanyum</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Pirinch</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Bakır</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Bronz</div>
<div class="mat-chip">Magnezyum</div>
</div>
<h3 class="mat-subtitle">◆ Plastik Malzemeler</h3>
<div class="mat-grid">
<div class="mat-chip">ABS</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PC</div>
<div class="mat-chip">POM (Delrin)</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PP</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PA (Naylon)</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PMMA (Akrilik)</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PE</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PTFE (Teflon)</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PEEK</div>
<div class="mat-chip">PPS</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 SURFACE 
<section class="surface-section" style="background:#f8f8f8">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-5">
<span class="section-tag">Yüzey İşlemleri</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Yüzey Kaplama Seçenekleri</h2>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Anodizasyon</h4><p>Alüminyum için koruyucu oksit tabaka, farklı renk seçenekleri.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Kumlama</h4><p>Yüzey temizleme ve pürüzlendirme, metal ve plastik uyumlu.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Siyah Oksit</h4><p>Korozyon dayanımı, çelik parçalar için ideal.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Toz Boya</h4><p>Aşınmaya dayanıklı düzgün kaplama.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Boya</h4><p>Sıvı boya ile metal ve plastik kaplama.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Galvanik Kaplama</h4><p>Nikel, krom, çinko ile korozyon koruması.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Elektroforez</h4><p>Homojen kaplama, metal parçalar için.</p></div></div>
<div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-6"><div class="surface-card"><h4>Polisaj</h4><p>Ayna yüzey kalitesi, Ra 0.2μm.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
 CTA 
<section class="page-cta">
<div class="container">
<h2>CNC Frezeleme Projeniz mi Var?</h2>
<p>CAD dosyanızı gönderin, 24 saat içinde ücretsiz teklif alın.</p>
<a class="cta-btn" href="/iletisim/">Hemen Teklif Al</a>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :root{--brand:#C93715;--brand-light:rgba(201,55,21,0.1);--dark:#1a1a1a;--text:#555;--title:#222}
        .page-hero{position:relative;height:450px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center}
        .page-hero .hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
        .page-hero .hero-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
        .page-hero .hero-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0.4) 60%,transparent 100%);z-index:1}
        .page-hero .hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;color:#fff}
        .page-hero h1{font-size:44px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:15px;font-family:var(--title-font-family);line-height:1.2}
        .page-hero h1 span{color:var(--brand)}
        .page-hero .hero-desc{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;opacity:0.85;max-width:550px;margin-bottom:25px}
        .page-hero .breadcrumb-nav{font-size:14px;opacity:0.6}
        .page-hero .breadcrumb-nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
        .hero-cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:14px 35px;border-radius:30px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s;font-size:15px}
        .hero-cta:hover{background:#a02e12;transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(201,55,21,0.4);color:#fff}
        .section-tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);padding:6px 20px;border-radius:20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:15px}
        .section-title{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin-bottom:20px;font-family:var(--title-font-family);line-height:1.3}
        .section-desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text);max-width:700px}

        /* WHAT IS */
        .intro-section{padding:80px 0}
        .intro-image{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}
        .intro-image img{width:100%;height:400px;object-fit:cover;display:block}
        .check-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:25px 0 0}
        .check-list li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6}
        .check-list li .ico{color:var(--brand);font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px}

        /* CAPABILITIES CARDS */
        .caps-section{padding:80px 0;background:#f8f8f8}
        .cap-card{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);transition:all 0.3s;margin-bottom:30px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0}
        .cap-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(201,55,21,0.12);border-color:rgba(201,55,21,0.2)}
        .cap-card .cap-visual{height:200px;background:var(--dark);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
        .cap-card .cap-visual .axis-label{font-size:72px;font-weight:900;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);position:absolute}
        .cap-card .cap-visual .axis-icon{font-size:48px;color:var(--brand);position:relative;z-index:1}
        .cap-card .cap-body{padding:25px 20px}
        .cap-card h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin-bottom:10px}
        .cap-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text);margin:0}
        .cap-card .cap-specs{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:12px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #f0f0f0;padding-top:12px}
        .cap-card .cap-specs li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);padding:4px 0}
        .cap-card .cap-specs li strong{color:var(--title)}

        /* STATS */
        .stats-section{padding:60px 0;background:var(--dark);color:#fff}
        .stat-box{text-align:center;padding:20px}
        .stat-number{font-size:48px;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand);font-family:var(--title-font-family)}
        .stat-label{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-top:5px}

        /* TABLE */
        .specs-section{padding:80px 0}
        .specs-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}
        .specs-table thead th{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:16px 24px;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-align:left}
        .specs-table tbody td{padding:14px 24px;font-size:15px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0}
        .specs-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#fafafa}
        .specs-table tbody tr:hover td{background:rgba(201,55,21,0.04)}
        .specs-table tbody td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:var(--title)}

        /* MATERIALS */
        .materials-section{padding:80px 0;background:#f8f8f8}
        .mat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:15px;margin-top:20px}
        .mat-chip{background:#fff;border:2px solid #eee;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 12px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--title);transition:all 0.3s;cursor:default}
        .mat-chip:hover{border-color:var(--brand);color:var(--brand);background:var(--brand-light);transform:translateY(-3px)}
        .mat-subtitle{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin:35px 0 10px;font-family:var(--title-font-family)}

        /* SURFACE */
        .surface-section{padding:80px 0}
        .surface-card{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);transition:all 0.3s;margin-bottom:20px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0}
        .surface-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);border-color:rgba(201,55,21,0.2)}
        .surface-card h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--title);margin-bottom:8px}
        .surface-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text);margin:0}

        /* CTA */
        .page-cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,#e04a28 100%);padding:60px 0;text-align:center;color:#fff}
        .page-cta h2{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:15px;font-family:var(--title-font-family)}
        .page-cta p{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:30px;opacity:0.9}
        .page-cta .cta-btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);padding:15px 45px;border-radius:30px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;transition:all 0.3s}
        .page-cta .cta-btn:hover{background:var(--dark);color:#fff}

        @media(max-width:768px){.page-hero{height:350px}.page-hero h1{font-size:28px}.section-title{font-size:24px}.intro-image img{height:280px}.stat-number{font-size:36px}}
</style>
